00:01:32.246 --> 00:01:35.584
=Flying Up Without Disturb=

00:01:36.032 --> 00:01:38.976
=Episode 7=

00:01:57.125 --> 00:01:57.903
Go!

00:01:58.528 --> 00:02:00.178
Go! Go!

00:02:00.416 --> 00:02:01.802
Go!

00:02:05.716 --> 00:02:06.835
What is it?

00:02:07.412 --> 00:02:08.852
I told you before.

00:02:08.852 --> 00:02:10.173
I'm also a music cultivator.

00:02:10.292 --> 00:02:12.093
So I'd like to seek your advice.

00:02:12.213 --> 00:02:13.493
What could I possibly teach you?

00:02:13.653 --> 00:02:15.132
Your Yunhua Sect is so powerful.

00:02:15.213 --> 00:02:16.493
They can't teach you properly?

00:02:17.012 --> 00:02:18.053
But I genuinely...

00:02:18.053 --> 00:02:19.012
Zhou Xiao is in danger.

00:02:19.012 --> 00:02:20.213
Stop talking to me.

00:02:20.412 --> 00:02:21.012
I...

00:02:50.016 --> 00:02:50.773
Zhou Xiao!

00:02:51.136 --> 00:02:52.053
Senior Zhou Xiao!

00:02:52.812 --> 00:02:54.132
Senior Zhou Xiao, are you okay?

00:02:54.173 --> 00:02:54.893
Senior Zhou Xiao!

00:02:57.893 --> 00:02:59.572
What are you going up there for?

00:02:59.572 --> 00:03:00.292
Senior Zhou Xiao.

00:03:00.292 --> 00:03:01.412
How are you feeling?

00:03:01.412 --> 00:03:02.176
Senior Zhou Xiao?

00:03:03.933 --> 00:03:05.572
No, I...

00:03:06.496 --> 00:03:08.453
Even that didn't work?

00:03:09.572 --> 00:03:12.453
Looks like I need
to use my ultimate move.

00:03:13.572 --> 00:03:15.732
The back mountain compound
is heavily guarded.

00:03:15.933 --> 00:03:16.972
If we force our way in,

00:03:17.053 --> 00:03:18.292
we'll definitely make noise.

00:03:19.093 --> 00:03:20.373
But apart from this,

00:03:20.493 --> 00:03:21.504
nowhere else has clues

00:03:21.504 --> 00:03:22.613
about the dark cultivators.

00:03:22.732 --> 00:03:23.412
Young Master,

00:03:23.532 --> 00:03:25.132
should we break in or not?

00:03:25.132 --> 00:03:26.613
Don't alert them yet.

00:03:27.292 --> 00:03:29.572
Keep watching Kong Hou
and the others these days.

00:03:29.773 --> 00:03:30.933
Zhou Xiao

00:03:31.053 --> 00:03:32.692
has ulterior motives.

00:03:38.292 --> 00:03:39.613
Look at you.

00:03:39.613 --> 00:03:40.512
What exactly

00:03:40.512 --> 00:03:41.812
will make you resonate?

00:03:47.132 --> 00:03:48.213
Senior Zhou Xiao.

00:03:49.173 --> 00:03:50.373
You're still injured.

00:03:50.373 --> 00:03:51.493
Why come to me now?

00:03:51.613 --> 00:03:52.893
Is there something urgent?

00:03:52.893 --> 00:03:53.572
My master

00:03:53.572 --> 00:03:55.012
feels bad for the poor reception.

00:03:55.012 --> 00:03:56.373
Being Yunhua Sect's old friend,

00:03:56.493 --> 00:03:57.280
he has a gift

00:03:57.280 --> 00:03:58.213
for Yunhua Sect.

00:03:58.333 --> 00:03:59.104
Please come with me

00:03:59.168 --> 00:04:00.532
to the Treasure Hall to fetch it.

00:04:00.864 --> 00:04:01.933
But...

00:04:01.933 --> 00:04:02.972
No need to decline.

00:04:03.093 --> 00:04:03.904
It's a gesture

00:04:03.904 --> 00:04:04.832
from our entire sect.

00:04:05.132 --> 00:04:07.732
Then I'll accept graciously.

00:04:07.732 --> 00:04:13.056
(Treasure Hall)

00:04:13.056 --> 00:04:13.653
This way.

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:21.088
(Treasure Hall)

00:04:29.568 --> 00:04:31.136
(Treasure Hall)

00:04:39.372 --> 00:04:40.412
Zhou Xiao,

00:04:40.412 --> 00:04:41.932
your Treasure Hall

00:04:42.013 --> 00:04:43.333
is so grand.

00:04:43.453 --> 00:04:44.773
Compared to our sect's,

00:04:44.773 --> 00:04:46.093
it's equally impressive.

00:04:46.453 --> 00:04:48.736
And there are so many rare treasures.

00:04:48.736 --> 00:04:49.532
You flatter me.

00:04:49.972 --> 00:04:51.392
My master collected them

00:04:51.392 --> 00:04:52.532
through great efforts.

00:04:52.972 --> 00:04:53.852
He believes

00:04:53.852 --> 00:04:55.172
that for a large sect like ours,

00:04:55.172 --> 00:04:56.128
without some

00:04:56.128 --> 00:04:57.013
presentable treasures,

00:04:57.013 --> 00:04:58.213
it's hard to command respect

00:04:58.333 --> 00:04:59.972
or establish ourselves in Lingyou Realm.

00:05:00.932 --> 00:05:02.133
Zhou Xiao,

00:05:02.292 --> 00:05:03.932
your sect

00:05:03.932 --> 00:05:05.292
has so many treasures

00:05:05.453 --> 00:05:07.453
and abundant spiritual veins.

00:05:07.612 --> 00:05:08.893
And your disciples cultivate

00:05:08.893 --> 00:05:10.133
with great diligence.

00:05:10.368 --> 00:05:11.732
I believe given time,

00:05:11.852 --> 00:05:13.333
you'll surely prosper more.

00:05:13.453 --> 00:05:15.333
(Her heart is so pure and kind.)

00:05:15.333 --> 00:05:16.453
(Yet I...)

00:05:17.292 --> 00:05:19.013
(Forgive me, Lady Kong Hou.)

00:05:19.648 --> 00:05:20.412
What's this?

00:05:25.952 --> 00:05:27.072
Danger! Run!

00:05:29.532 --> 00:05:30.813
What happened?

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:34.592
- Lady Kong Hou.
- Anyone outside?

00:05:34.656 --> 00:05:35.424
Stop banging.

00:05:37.088 --> 00:05:39.488
What's going on?

00:05:39.488 --> 00:05:40.160
Weren't we just

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:41.152
looking at treasures?

00:05:41.152 --> 00:05:42.016
Why suddenly...?

00:05:42.132 --> 00:05:42.880
The Treasure Hall

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:43.848
has an alert barrier.

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:45.056
We must have

00:05:45.056 --> 00:05:45.824
touched something

00:05:45.824 --> 00:05:46.449
to trigger it.

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:51.539
Then... Could it be what I...?

00:05:51.659 --> 00:05:52.859
The trickier thing is

00:05:52.859 --> 00:05:54.272
that once the barrier is triggered,

00:05:54.708 --> 00:05:56.227
it only opens from the outside.

00:05:58.208 --> 00:05:59.008
It was intentional?

00:06:01.088 --> 00:06:02.907
Yes, I saw it with my own eyes.

00:06:03.508 --> 00:06:05.227
After that person triggered the barrier,

00:06:05.308 --> 00:06:06.496
he locked the door and left.

00:06:06.496 --> 00:06:07.948
There were no further actions.

00:06:08.868 --> 00:06:10.227
Can that barrier

00:06:11.108 --> 00:06:12.308
be opened?

00:06:12.428 --> 00:06:13.188
It can.

00:06:13.308 --> 00:06:14.907
It only requires some spiritual energy.

00:06:15.347 --> 00:06:17.628
Good, keep watching.

00:06:17.787 --> 00:06:18.667
Remember.

00:06:18.827 --> 00:06:19.628
Do not alert them

00:06:19.628 --> 00:06:20.667
unless utterly necessary.

00:06:20.787 --> 00:06:21.707
But if...

00:06:21.868 --> 00:06:23.027
But if

00:06:23.108 --> 00:06:24.428
Lady Kong Hou is in danger,

00:06:24.587 --> 00:06:26.147
I'll break the barrier to save her.

00:06:26.267 --> 00:06:26.827
Got it.

00:06:34.068 --> 00:06:36.428
How on earth can we get out?

00:06:37.667 --> 00:06:39.548
Normally,

00:06:40.108 --> 00:06:40.907
tomorrow morning,

00:06:40.907 --> 00:06:42.188
disciples will come to clean.

00:06:44.147 --> 00:06:45.347
What?

00:06:45.628 --> 00:06:46.948
You mean

00:06:47.068 --> 00:06:49.068
we have to stay in this Treasure Hall

00:06:49.188 --> 00:06:50.827
until tomorrow morning?

00:06:55.628 --> 00:06:56.787
How about this,

00:06:56.827 --> 00:06:57.787
Zhou Xiao?

00:06:57.948 --> 00:06:59.188
Let's join forces

00:06:59.347 --> 00:07:00.188
to break the barrier

00:07:00.347 --> 00:07:02.144
with spiritual energy.

00:07:02.592 --> 00:07:03.667
Lady Kong Hou,

00:07:04.467 --> 00:07:05.428
a unique spell

00:07:05.508 --> 00:07:06.748
of our sect has been cast

00:07:06.748 --> 00:07:07.827
on this barrier.

00:07:07.948 --> 00:07:09.108
With our current cultivation,

00:07:09.108 --> 00:07:10.347
we can't open it from inside.

00:07:10.347 --> 00:07:11.347
Unless Master were here.

00:07:11.840 --> 00:07:12.736
But now...

00:07:13.868 --> 00:07:15.188
S-So we

00:07:15.188 --> 00:07:16.787
really have to stay here

00:07:16.787 --> 00:07:18.560
all night?

00:07:18.707 --> 00:07:19.648
Exactly.

00:07:26.144 --> 00:07:27.104
Zhou Xiao,

00:07:27.707 --> 00:07:29.868
why does it seem like

00:07:30.068 --> 00:07:31.428
you aren't too worried?

00:07:34.267 --> 00:07:35.388
When I was young,

00:07:35.388 --> 00:07:36.587
I got locked up often.

00:07:36.868 --> 00:07:37.868
I was scared at first.

00:07:37.868 --> 00:07:39.328
Then I learned the door

00:07:39.328 --> 00:07:40.868
would open by dawn at the latest.

00:07:41.027 --> 00:07:41.787
The fear faded.

00:07:42.267 --> 00:07:43.027
No more fear.

00:07:46.428 --> 00:07:47.628
If this weren't

00:07:47.628 --> 00:07:49.227
your sect's place

00:07:49.508 --> 00:07:50.748
and I feared

00:07:50.868 --> 00:07:52.227
damaging these treasures,

00:07:52.448 --> 00:07:53.152
I would've

00:07:53.696 --> 00:07:55.520
already taken out

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:56.832
all my spiritual tools

00:07:57.216 --> 00:07:59.548
to test them one by one.

00:07:59.667 --> 00:08:00.787
I refuse to believe

00:08:01.027 --> 00:08:01.907
we couldn't break

00:08:01.907 --> 00:08:03.347
your barrier.

00:08:04.108 --> 00:08:05.628
Right.

00:08:05.748 --> 00:08:06.667
Lady Kong Hou,

00:08:07.027 --> 00:08:08.480
this is indeed our sect's

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:09.428
extremely,

00:08:09.428 --> 00:08:10.496
extremely important place.

00:08:10.907 --> 00:08:13.280
Thank you for holding back.

00:08:17.628 --> 00:08:18.267
Forget it.

00:08:18.587 --> 00:08:19.628
Blame me instead.

00:08:22.308 --> 00:08:23.347
My curiosity

00:08:23.347 --> 00:08:24.147
and recklessness

00:08:24.267 --> 00:08:25.248
brought this on us.

00:08:26.905 --> 00:08:28.330
(Treasure Hall)

00:08:28.587 --> 00:08:29.628
Treasure...

00:08:30.464 --> 00:08:31.936
Treasure Hall.

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:34.027
Zhou Xiao is interesting.

00:08:34.656 --> 00:08:36.348
He trapped himself with Kong Hou

00:08:36.348 --> 00:08:37.088
on purpose.

00:08:38.267 --> 00:08:39.427
This man

00:08:39.588 --> 00:08:40.896
looks presentable,

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:42.016
but he's up to no good.

00:08:43.552 --> 00:08:45.440
(Treasure Hall)

00:08:46.108 --> 00:08:47.267
How is it?

00:08:48.672 --> 00:08:50.464
Young Master is so nagging.

00:08:50.868 --> 00:08:51.868
I already said,

00:08:51.868 --> 00:08:52.640
I'll act at once

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:54.187
if Lady Kong Hou is in danger.

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:58.508
He never cared this much about me.

00:08:58.508 --> 00:09:01.440
(Treasure Hall)

00:09:15.072 --> 00:09:15.712
Today, we must

00:09:15.712 --> 00:09:17.216
clean the Treasure Hall thoroughly.

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:18.260
Otherwise...

00:09:19.979 --> 00:09:21.780
Zhou Xiao? Lady Kong Hou?

00:09:21.940 --> 00:09:23.060
Why are you here?

00:09:23.060 --> 00:09:24.099
What's going on?

00:09:25.539 --> 00:09:27.499
Yesterday, I took Lady Kong Hou
to pick a gift.

00:09:27.499 --> 00:09:28.780
We triggered the barrier.

00:09:28.780 --> 00:09:29.619
You two stayed here

00:09:29.619 --> 00:09:30.859
the entire night?

00:09:30.979 --> 00:09:32.499
An unmarried man and woman alone?

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:34.140
An unmarried man and woman?

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:34.688
Wait.

00:09:34.688 --> 00:09:36.544
Are you misunderstanding something?

00:09:36.544 --> 00:09:37.244
Senior Zhou Xiao,

00:09:37.459 --> 00:09:38.240
do you perhaps

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:39.968
have feelings for Lady Kong Hou?

00:09:39.968 --> 00:09:40.819
Exactly.

00:09:40.819 --> 00:09:42.140
How could you do this?

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:42.819
Mao Mao.

00:09:44.739 --> 00:09:45.699
Stop talking nonsense.

00:09:46.260 --> 00:09:47.300
We were

00:09:47.859 --> 00:09:50.560
together all night,

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:52.540
but nothing happened.

00:09:52.859 --> 00:09:54.619
Nothing happened at all.

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:56.619
I swear nothing happened.

00:09:59.020 --> 00:10:01.099
Why does it feel like

00:10:01.219 --> 00:10:03.099
I'm making the situation worse
by explaining?

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:04.780
Senior Zhou Xiao, you...

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:07.020
You actually slept together?

00:10:07.680 --> 00:10:08.380
No.

00:10:08.380 --> 00:10:09.420
- No.
- No wonder Zhou Xiao

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:11.219
- Not at all.
- didn't return all night.

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:13.420
He was having a secret rendezvous here.

00:10:13.420 --> 00:10:14.859
No, that's not true.

00:10:14.859 --> 00:10:15.940
Zhou Xiao,

00:10:16.352 --> 00:10:17.984
explain this properly.

00:10:17.984 --> 00:10:18.528
We truly

00:10:18.528 --> 00:10:19.940
had no improper contact.

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:21.099
Lady Kong Hou,

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:23.260
last night

00:10:24.260 --> 00:10:25.536
was an accident,

00:10:26.339 --> 00:10:28.540
but I do...

00:10:28.660 --> 00:10:29.739
Wait.

00:10:30.099 --> 00:10:31.140
Zhou Xiao,

00:10:31.140 --> 00:10:32.459
have you lost your mind?

00:10:32.459 --> 00:10:33.219
Last night

00:10:33.219 --> 00:10:34.859
you were acting perfectly normal.

00:10:34.979 --> 00:10:36.660
Don't let those ridiculous

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:38.560
'male-female propriety' notions

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:39.900
mess with your head.

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:41.780
S-Snap out of it.

00:10:42.180 --> 00:10:43.619
Senior Zhou Xiao, Lady Kong Hou,

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:44.499
listen to me.

00:10:44.699 --> 00:10:45.900
Given the situation,

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:47.459
let our sect leader decide.

00:10:47.459 --> 00:10:48.380
What do you think?

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:49.380
- Agreed.
- Agreed.

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:50.540
- Let our sect leader decide.
- Yes.

00:10:50.739 --> 00:10:51.660
What?

00:10:53.216 --> 00:10:54.619
- So,
- Yes. Let our sect leader decide.

00:10:54.780 --> 00:10:57.380
this is the Yuanji Sect's purpose.

00:10:58.459 --> 00:10:59.940
Impressive.

00:10:59.979 --> 00:11:01.140
Kong Hou

00:11:01.140 --> 00:11:02.940
is in big trouble now.

00:11:05.979 --> 00:11:07.780
Rules make order.

00:11:07.780 --> 00:11:09.619
Decorum must be maintained.

00:11:09.739 --> 00:11:10.420
You...

00:11:10.819 --> 00:11:12.940
What have you done?

00:11:13.739 --> 00:11:14.464
You've...

00:11:14.464 --> 00:11:15.136
You've ruined

00:11:15.136 --> 00:11:17.339
Lady Kong Hou's reputation.

00:11:17.536 --> 00:11:18.540
Lady Kong Hou,

00:11:18.540 --> 00:11:19.619
I'm terribly sorry.

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:21.280
It's not that serious.

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:22.900
Master Shuang Qing, you exaggerate.

00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:23.619
I do?

00:11:23.739 --> 00:11:25.699
The situation demands severity.

00:11:25.859 --> 00:11:28.300
However, we are the Yuanji Sect.

00:11:28.420 --> 00:11:29.859
Lady Kong Hou, rest assured.

00:11:29.859 --> 00:11:31.140
We would never

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:32.699
act so irresponsibly.

00:11:32.940 --> 00:11:34.300
I will definitely give you

00:11:34.459 --> 00:11:35.648
and the Yunhua Sect

00:11:35.648 --> 00:11:36.579
a proper resolution.

00:11:36.699 --> 00:11:38.300
What resolution?

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:39.180
We don't need it.

00:11:39.339 --> 00:11:39.900
You do.

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:41.140
How couldn't you?

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:42.464
Wait, Master...

00:11:42.464 --> 00:11:43.060
Silence.

00:11:43.099 --> 00:11:44.020
She doesn't. You do.

00:11:44.020 --> 00:11:44.619
And you don't.

00:11:44.704 --> 00:11:45.540
She doesn't. You do.

00:11:45.540 --> 00:11:46.940
You don't. But she needs it.

00:11:49.568 --> 00:11:50.619
It's really nothing.

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:52.896
Cultivators don't fuss
over trivialities.

00:11:52.896 --> 00:11:53.780
I don't mind at all.

00:11:53.780 --> 00:11:54.944
Besides,

00:11:54.944 --> 00:11:56.699
nothing happened at all.

00:11:58.540 --> 00:12:01.060
How could 'nothing happen'?

00:12:01.219 --> 00:12:03.020
You were in this situation.

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:06.060
Well...

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:08.459
Good girl. Innocent young lady.

00:12:08.459 --> 00:12:09.300
At this moment,

00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:11.140
you should stop making excuses for him.

00:12:11.739 --> 00:12:12.864
For your innocence

00:12:13.472 --> 00:12:14.819
and your happiness,

00:12:15.099 --> 00:12:16.380
I'll make the decision.

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:17.979
I'll make the decision for you.

00:12:18.260 --> 00:12:19.020
Zhou Xiao,

00:12:19.140 --> 00:12:20.420
immediately and right now,

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:22.496
marry Lady Kong Hou.

00:12:27.808 --> 00:12:29.984
(Kunze Hall)

00:12:29.984 --> 00:12:32.000
(Joy)

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:34.272
(Kunze Hall)

00:12:37.376 --> 00:12:39.712
(Joy)

00:12:45.020 --> 00:12:46.339
Don't waste your efforts.

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:55.420
To think the Yuanji Sect

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:56.224
would resort

00:12:56.224 --> 00:12:57.420
to such shameless tactics.

00:12:57.699 --> 00:12:59.300
You clearly set me up.

00:12:59.459 --> 00:13:01.140
All to force me into marrying Zhou Xiao.

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:02.336
Why exactly

00:13:02.336 --> 00:13:03.459
am I so alluring to you?

00:13:03.579 --> 00:13:04.979
Do I possess some hidden treasure?

00:13:07.060 --> 00:13:09.579
Or is it because

00:13:10.339 --> 00:13:12.140
I'm a disciple of Yunhua Sect?

00:13:12.260 --> 00:13:13.420
We must obey Master's order.

00:13:13.819 --> 00:13:15.072
Senior Zhou Xiao is a good man.

00:13:16.219 --> 00:13:17.339
A good man?

00:13:17.499 --> 00:13:19.420
Would a good man scheme
to force a marriage?

00:13:22.219 --> 00:13:23.579
He'll treat you well.

00:13:24.060 --> 00:13:25.180
Aren't you afraid

00:13:25.339 --> 00:13:26.780
of provoking Yunhua Sect's wrath?

00:13:26.940 --> 00:13:27.979
The die is cast.

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:28.699
However

00:13:28.699 --> 00:13:30.020
unconventional your sect may be,

00:13:30.339 --> 00:13:31.459
you still value face.

00:13:35.619 --> 00:13:36.579
And what about you?

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:42.140
Do you feel no resentment at all?

00:13:44.699 --> 00:13:45.699
I know

00:13:46.579 --> 00:13:47.780
you have feelings for him.

00:13:48.219 --> 00:13:49.499
You're fellow disciples

00:13:49.660 --> 00:13:51.020
who grew up together.

00:13:51.219 --> 00:13:52.619
It's an irreplaceable bond.

00:13:52.979 --> 00:13:53.859
Your connection

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:55.979
transcends any ordinary relationship.

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:57.660
Lady Jin Ling,

00:13:57.819 --> 00:13:59.579
deep down, you must know

00:13:59.699 --> 00:14:00.859
that Zhou Xiao doesn't truly

00:14:00.979 --> 00:14:01.984
have feelings for me.

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:03.819
Even if we marry,

00:14:04.020 --> 00:14:06.099
he'll never find true happiness.

00:14:07.328 --> 00:14:08.736
(Joy)

00:14:09.859 --> 00:14:11.859
But our master taught us from childhood

00:14:12.020 --> 00:14:13.140
to aim for the greater good

00:14:13.140 --> 00:14:14.219
and to put the sect first.

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:15.328
But what if your master

00:14:15.328 --> 00:14:16.459
is wrong about this?

00:14:17.099 --> 00:14:18.739
My master always told me

00:14:19.104 --> 00:14:21.099
that though I'm a part of Yunhua Sect,

00:14:21.260 --> 00:14:23.140
I must remain true to myself.

00:14:23.900 --> 00:14:25.420
If after all cultivation,

00:14:25.579 --> 00:14:26.699
one can't even preserve

00:14:26.699 --> 00:14:27.900
their own true heart,

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:28.979
then tell me,

00:14:29.140 --> 00:14:31.420
what's even the purpose of cultivation?

00:14:33.380 --> 00:14:34.459
Lady Jin Ling,

00:14:35.264 --> 00:14:37.180
if you do have feelings for Zhou Xiao,

00:14:37.499 --> 00:14:39.540
you should fight

00:14:39.808 --> 00:14:41.940
to be with him forever.

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:42.859
I believe

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:44.819
the one wearing this bridal gown

00:14:45.339 --> 00:14:47.180
should be you.

00:14:58.432 --> 00:14:59.424
Master. Master.

00:15:05.504 --> 00:15:06.180
Master,

00:15:06.336 --> 00:15:07.168
Yuanji Sect

00:15:07.168 --> 00:15:08.224
forces me into marriage.

00:15:08.224 --> 00:15:09.140
Come quickly.

00:15:09.339 --> 00:15:10.464
Their square-faced

00:15:10.464 --> 00:15:11.296
Master Shuang Qing

00:15:11.296 --> 00:15:12.160
is the culprit.

00:15:12.576 --> 00:15:13.540
Square-faced?

00:15:14.459 --> 00:15:16.832
This is dignified solemnity.

00:15:16.832 --> 00:15:18.020
Master. Master.

00:15:21.819 --> 00:15:22.688
Master,

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:24.219
Young Master and I are fine.

00:15:24.219 --> 00:15:25.856
We're traveling in Sanshu City.

00:15:26.016 --> 00:15:27.859
Yuanji Sect has been most hospitable.

00:15:28.140 --> 00:15:28.832
We even met

00:15:28.832 --> 00:15:30.339
Yunhua Sect's Lady Kong Hou.

00:15:37.739 --> 00:15:39.819
Young Master, let's crash the wedding.

00:15:40.579 --> 00:15:41.420
Look.

00:15:41.619 --> 00:15:43.424
As anticipated, our messenger talisman

00:15:43.424 --> 00:15:44.499
was intercepted.

00:15:44.619 --> 00:15:45.792
This proves Yuanji Sect

00:15:45.792 --> 00:15:47.260
is definitely shady.

00:15:47.744 --> 00:15:48.544
Moreover,

00:15:48.640 --> 00:15:50.208
we don't know Shuang Qing

00:15:50.208 --> 00:15:51.300
and Yuanji Sect's schemes

00:15:51.459 --> 00:15:52.380
or if they're related

00:15:52.499 --> 00:15:53.619
to the dark cultivators.

00:15:53.619 --> 00:15:54.260
But

00:15:54.420 --> 00:15:55.780
forcing Kong Hou into marriage

00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:56.819
is an undeniable fact.

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:02.979
Young Master,

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:04.480
we must help

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:05.459
Lady Kong Hou.

00:16:05.696 --> 00:16:06.592
Besides,

00:16:06.819 --> 00:16:08.420
Master Song He

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:09.540
and her master, Wang Tong,

00:16:09.619 --> 00:16:11.099
are actually good friends.

00:16:11.260 --> 00:16:12.352
By all means,

00:16:12.352 --> 00:16:14.208
we can't just stand by.

00:16:16.060 --> 00:16:17.099
How should we do it?

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:18.619
How should we do it?

00:16:19.859 --> 00:16:20.859
Well,

00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:23.296
let's just...

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:25.579
I mean, I've never

00:16:25.660 --> 00:16:26.592
done this before.

00:16:26.688 --> 00:16:27.424
But,

00:16:28.288 --> 00:16:29.140
I guess

00:16:29.140 --> 00:16:30.219
we should wait until they

00:16:30.219 --> 00:16:31.264
begin the ceremony,

00:16:31.264 --> 00:16:32.192
and then we storm in.

00:16:32.192 --> 00:16:33.219
We cut through everyone,

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:34.699
and rescue Lady Kong Hou.

00:16:35.168 --> 00:16:36.420
Or perhaps we should

00:16:36.420 --> 00:16:38.219
wait until the dead of night

00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:39.819
when Lady Kong Hou is asleep.

00:16:39.979 --> 00:16:41.632
Then we'll stealthily

00:16:41.632 --> 00:16:42.300
carry her away.

00:16:42.300 --> 00:16:44.224
Either way,

00:16:44.224 --> 00:16:44.896
we mustn't

00:16:44.896 --> 00:16:46.080
let the Yuanji Sect villains

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:46.944
succeed.

00:16:46.944 --> 00:16:47.872
Right?

00:16:48.339 --> 00:16:49.739
By your logic,

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:51.180
we're the real villains.

00:16:51.260 --> 00:16:52.180
Then tell me

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:54.260
what we should do

00:16:54.339 --> 00:16:55.380
if nothing works for you.

00:16:55.900 --> 00:16:56.979
Let's wait longer.

00:16:58.020 --> 00:16:59.540
Given Kong Hou's personality,

00:17:01.979 --> 00:17:03.616
she won't submit easily.

00:17:08.352 --> 00:17:11.936
(Joy)

00:17:44.900 --> 00:17:45.940
Lady Kong Hou,

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:47.539
marriage

00:17:47.860 --> 00:17:48.779
is never just a matter

00:17:48.779 --> 00:17:49.699
between two people.

00:17:50.059 --> 00:17:50.779
Perhaps

00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:54.380
this is our destined fate.

00:18:14.059 --> 00:18:14.979
Jin Ling?

00:18:15.299 --> 00:18:16.499
What's wrong?

00:18:16.699 --> 00:18:17.820
Am I not good enough?

00:18:17.979 --> 00:18:19.180
What's going on?

00:18:20.219 --> 00:18:21.219
Where's Lady Kong Hou?

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:24.180
Senior Zhou Xiao,

00:18:24.699 --> 00:18:26.219
do you really like her?

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:27.779
Are you truly content

00:18:27.779 --> 00:18:29.219
to spend your life with her?

00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:30.699
What does that matter?

00:18:31.019 --> 00:18:31.860
Stop the fuss.

00:18:31.940 --> 00:18:33.100
Where is Lady Kong Hou?

00:18:33.180 --> 00:18:34.420
Senior Zhou Xiao,

00:18:35.299 --> 00:18:36.259
do you truly not know,

00:18:36.259 --> 00:18:37.459
or are you pretending?

00:18:38.016 --> 00:18:39.580
I have feelings for you.

00:18:45.539 --> 00:18:46.979
We must obey Master's order.

00:18:49.380 --> 00:18:50.900
I'll ask you one last time.

00:18:51.459 --> 00:18:52.820
Where is Lady Kong Hou?

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:54.112
Don't hide behind

00:18:54.112 --> 00:18:54.860
your orders.

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:56.192
Today I'll go with you

00:18:56.192 --> 00:18:57.140
to see Master.

00:19:00.100 --> 00:19:01.140
Senior Zhou Xiao,

00:19:02.900 --> 00:19:04.180
I don't believe

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:07.059
there's no place for me in your heart.

00:19:46.259 --> 00:19:47.380
She escaped?

00:19:48.059 --> 00:19:49.140
She did?

00:19:51.299 --> 00:19:52.580
She actually did?

00:19:53.248 --> 00:19:54.848
How could a Foundation-stage cultivator

00:19:54.848 --> 00:19:56.380
break through the barrier?

00:19:56.499 --> 00:19:57.660
What happened?

00:19:58.140 --> 00:19:58.739
Perhaps

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:00.259
she has some special spiritual tool.

00:20:02.019 --> 00:20:03.660
No matter what she possesses,

00:20:03.860 --> 00:20:05.059
mobilize all disciples

00:20:05.259 --> 00:20:07.620
and find her at all costs!

00:20:07.779 --> 00:20:08.380
Yes.

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:09.420
Follow me.

00:20:11.699 --> 00:20:14.459
Find her!

00:20:17.059 --> 00:20:18.180
Do you think today's feast

00:20:18.180 --> 00:20:18.900
will still happen?

00:20:19.100 --> 00:20:19.779
That depends

00:20:19.779 --> 00:20:21.219
on whether the bride escapes.

00:20:22.499 --> 00:20:23.620
Let's get prepared anyway.

00:20:24.019 --> 00:20:24.896
Agreed.

00:20:25.056 --> 00:20:25.728
Mao Mao,

00:20:26.380 --> 00:20:27.900
bring in those two vegetable baskets.

00:20:31.104 --> 00:20:32.180
Get to work.

00:20:51.616 --> 00:20:52.299
Who's there?

00:20:52.820 --> 00:20:54.340
C-Catch birds.

00:20:54.340 --> 00:20:56.820
C-Catch birds.

00:20:56.820 --> 00:20:57.739
Who are you?

00:20:58.019 --> 00:21:00.459
Z-Zhang Feng.

00:21:01.779 --> 00:21:04.096
M-My father... My father...

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:07.712
Zhang Feng? Your name is Zhang Feng?

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:09.940
Your father is Master Shuang Qing?

00:21:11.860 --> 00:21:13.856
I never expected Master Shuang Qing

00:21:13.856 --> 00:21:14.624
to have such

00:21:14.624 --> 00:21:15.820
a simple-minded son.

00:21:15.820 --> 00:21:16.499
Young Miss.

00:21:16.499 --> 00:21:18.336
Young Miss, help me catch them.

00:21:19.776 --> 00:21:20.860
Keep it down.

00:21:21.019 --> 00:21:22.979
It's completely dark now.

00:21:22.979 --> 00:21:24.739
The birds have all gone to sleep.

00:21:24.820 --> 00:21:25.900
Listen, be good.

00:21:26.100 --> 00:21:27.872
I'll give you something tasty.

00:21:27.872 --> 00:21:28.480
How about it?

00:21:37.059 --> 00:21:37.792
Is it good?

00:21:39.059 --> 00:21:40.448
Slow down.

00:21:40.672 --> 00:21:41.664
Why are you out here

00:21:41.664 --> 00:21:42.340
at this time?

00:21:42.340 --> 00:21:44.420
I-I want to play with the birds.

00:21:44.420 --> 00:21:45.380
There are none inside.

00:21:45.539 --> 00:21:46.699
I want to go out.

00:21:47.140 --> 00:21:48.259
Sneak out.

00:21:48.259 --> 00:21:49.940
Can't let them find out.

00:21:50.459 --> 00:21:52.340
Sneak out to play with birds?

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:53.940
Besides the main gate,

00:21:53.940 --> 00:21:54.976
do you know

00:21:54.976 --> 00:21:55.779
any other way out?

00:21:55.940 --> 00:21:57.340
Yes.

00:22:01.900 --> 00:22:03.299
Mao Mao?

00:22:05.056 --> 00:22:06.660
No wonder it took you so long.

00:22:06.660 --> 00:22:07.900
You fell asleep here.

00:22:09.380 --> 00:22:10.720
H-How did I fall asleep?

00:22:10.784 --> 00:22:11.940
Get up and work now.

00:22:12.059 --> 00:22:13.340
Stop dawdling.

00:22:13.340 --> 00:22:13.900
Come on.

00:22:15.259 --> 00:22:15.900
Let's go.

00:22:16.672 --> 00:22:17.792
Young Miss, come.

00:22:18.219 --> 00:22:19.019
Where is it?

00:22:19.072 --> 00:22:20.219
Just ahead.

00:22:20.219 --> 00:22:21.340
A-Ahead.

00:22:25.504 --> 00:22:26.699
Young Miss, over here.

00:22:27.259 --> 00:22:28.340
This?

00:22:30.944 --> 00:22:31.779
You go back first.

00:22:31.968 --> 00:22:33.100
It's too late now.

00:22:33.259 --> 00:22:34.380
The birds are asleep.

00:22:34.539 --> 00:22:35.520
Wait until the dawn.

00:22:35.520 --> 00:22:36.459
When you wake up,

00:22:36.499 --> 00:22:37.660
the birds will be up too.

00:22:37.860 --> 00:22:38.620
By the way,

00:22:38.880 --> 00:22:40.352
you mustn't tell anyone

00:22:40.352 --> 00:22:41.088
that you saw me.

00:22:41.900 --> 00:22:43.219
A secret.

00:22:43.660 --> 00:22:44.736
Yes, a secret.

00:22:44.736 --> 00:22:45.728
Sure.

00:22:46.340 --> 00:22:47.019
A secret.

00:22:47.059 --> 00:22:47.660
Right.

00:22:47.779 --> 00:22:48.380
A secret.

00:23:20.940 --> 00:23:22.080
What's this?

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:24.704
Let me go.

00:23:53.140 --> 00:23:54.860
Huan Zong, why did it take you so long?

00:23:55.219 --> 00:23:56.100
Sorry, I'm late.

00:23:57.820 --> 00:24:00.219
These vines are dangerous.

00:24:00.259 --> 00:24:01.059
The flowers...

00:24:01.059 --> 00:24:01.739
I know.

00:24:03.219 --> 00:24:04.180
Give me your hand.

00:24:24.512 --> 00:24:25.820
You're fine. Get up.

00:24:28.380 --> 00:24:29.140
Go back with them

00:24:29.140 --> 00:24:29.940
to buy some time.

00:24:30.259 --> 00:24:31.499
Leave the rest to me.

00:24:31.820 --> 00:24:33.059
I'll find a way.

00:24:33.259 --> 00:24:33.940
Trust me.

00:24:35.040 --> 00:24:35.968
I think

00:24:35.968 --> 00:24:37.059
I saw something over there

00:24:37.100 --> 00:24:37.940
just now...

00:24:43.900 --> 00:24:44.739
Huan Zong?

00:24:47.328 --> 00:24:50.018
(Joy)

00:25:00.800 --> 00:25:02.272
(What exactly are the vines)

00:25:02.272 --> 00:25:03.380
(in that flower field?)

00:25:03.810 --> 00:25:05.400
(Absorbing spiritual energy with them)

00:25:05.400 --> 00:25:06.720
(clearly isn't what proper sects)

00:25:06.720 --> 00:25:07.539
(would do.)

00:25:08.224 --> 00:25:09.440
(Why would Yuanji Sect)

00:25:09.440 --> 00:25:10.499
(act so viciously?)

00:25:11.299 --> 00:25:13.140
(Did they force me to marry Zhou Xiao)

00:25:13.376 --> 00:25:14.779
(to drain my spiritual energy?)

00:25:15.392 --> 00:25:17.539
(But I barely have
any spiritual energy.)

00:25:25.860 --> 00:25:27.180
Lady Kong Hou,

00:25:27.340 --> 00:25:29.739
you ran away on your wedding night.

00:25:29.860 --> 00:25:30.912
How can Zhou Xiao

00:25:30.912 --> 00:25:31.979
face others now?

00:25:32.219 --> 00:25:34.259
Fate is heaven-ordained.

00:25:34.340 --> 00:25:36.259
You two make a perfect match.

00:25:36.259 --> 00:25:37.580
A golden couple destined to be.

00:25:37.660 --> 00:25:39.860
Treasure this bond.

00:25:41.792 --> 00:25:43.539
(How theatrical.)

00:25:43.744 --> 00:25:45.660
(Never mind.
I'll follow Huan Zong's plan)

00:25:45.820 --> 00:25:47.019
(to buy some time.)

00:25:48.704 --> 00:25:49.632
I...

00:25:50.592 --> 00:25:51.424
Don't you know

00:25:51.424 --> 00:25:52.992
marriage is a major event?

00:25:53.824 --> 00:25:55.779
This is my first wedding.

00:25:55.779 --> 00:25:57.539
You need to give me some time to adjust.

00:25:57.900 --> 00:25:58.660
Besides,

00:25:58.820 --> 00:26:00.140
for such a major life event,

00:26:00.544 --> 00:26:01.824
even if the sect elders

00:26:01.824 --> 00:26:02.660
can't be present,

00:26:03.040 --> 00:26:05.380
the proper rituals
must still be observed.

00:26:05.620 --> 00:26:07.140
We mustn't rush the wedding.

00:26:07.499 --> 00:26:08.299
Anyway,

00:26:08.576 --> 00:26:09.344
the wedding

00:26:09.344 --> 00:26:10.624
is a once-in-a-lifetime event.

00:26:11.019 --> 00:26:12.979
I must have a grand ceremony.

00:26:20.739 --> 00:26:23.328
Fine. I'll give you your grand ceremony.

00:26:23.539 --> 00:26:25.219
But Lady Kong Hou,

00:26:25.660 --> 00:26:28.499
you must keep your word.

00:26:28.640 --> 00:26:30.019
Otherwise...

00:26:32.380 --> 00:26:33.140
Wait.

00:26:33.344 --> 00:26:34.720
Undo the immobilization spell

00:26:34.720 --> 00:26:35.620
on me at least.

00:26:36.352 --> 00:26:37.760
It'll naturally wear off

00:26:38.080 --> 00:26:39.424
in two hours.

00:26:50.180 --> 00:26:51.979
This girl is cunning.

00:26:51.979 --> 00:26:53.620
- No more mishaps.
- Senior Zhou Xiao.

00:26:53.620 --> 00:26:54.620
She must not escape.

00:26:55.100 --> 00:26:55.779
Understood.

00:27:18.752 --> 00:27:20.544
He told me to buy time.

00:27:20.704 --> 00:27:22.140
What should I do next?

00:27:22.624 --> 00:27:24.416
Why hasn't Huan Zong come yet?

00:27:37.299 --> 00:27:38.496
What do you want?

00:27:38.496 --> 00:27:39.200
It's too stuffy.

00:27:39.232 --> 00:27:40.820
Can't I get some fresh air?

00:27:41.900 --> 00:27:42.580
Well...

00:27:42.944 --> 00:27:44.100
I'm hungry.

00:27:44.100 --> 00:27:44.820
You should

00:27:44.820 --> 00:27:45.900
at least give me some food.

00:27:46.059 --> 00:27:46.940
H-How about this?

00:27:47.259 --> 00:27:48.420
You can escort me there.

00:27:48.580 --> 00:27:49.979
I won't try to escape.

00:27:50.100 --> 00:27:51.180
Eat something.

00:27:51.940 --> 00:27:53.180
I had it specially prepared.

00:27:53.632 --> 00:27:54.820
They're your favorites.

00:28:03.100 --> 00:28:04.979
I can't sway my master's decisions.

00:28:06.528 --> 00:28:07.660
Yuanji Sect has lingered

00:28:07.820 --> 00:28:09.380
outside the Ten Great Sects for years.

00:28:09.900 --> 00:28:11.739
My master has exhausted every effort,

00:28:12.580 --> 00:28:14.499
but over the past decade,

00:28:14.660 --> 00:28:16.420
our disciples
have shown mediocre talent.

00:28:16.864 --> 00:28:17.792
That's why

00:28:18.144 --> 00:28:19.660
he sought external support.

00:28:19.968 --> 00:28:21.100
If I marry you,

00:28:21.100 --> 00:28:22.112
our sect

00:28:22.112 --> 00:28:23.340
could gain aid from your sect.

00:28:23.499 --> 00:28:24.660
It would elevate our standing

00:28:24.820 --> 00:28:25.900
in Lingyou Realm.

00:28:26.100 --> 00:28:27.340
How long have you

00:28:27.340 --> 00:28:28.299
been targeting me?

00:28:30.259 --> 00:28:31.180
Back in Qiu City.

00:28:31.380 --> 00:28:33.340
After the Zhaohan Sect's phoenix case,

00:28:33.696 --> 00:28:34.940
your reputation soared.

00:28:34.940 --> 00:28:36.219
And that's how we traced

00:28:36.620 --> 00:28:38.499
your movements after leaving your sect.

00:28:39.580 --> 00:28:40.979
The previous dark cultivators

00:28:41.600 --> 00:28:42.979
were our sect members in disguise.

00:28:43.616 --> 00:28:44.180
All this

00:28:44.380 --> 00:28:45.779
was to make us acquainted.

00:28:46.340 --> 00:28:48.288
You must be out of your minds.

00:28:48.288 --> 00:28:49.056
True.

00:28:50.019 --> 00:28:51.660
Though you don't care for me,

00:28:51.820 --> 00:28:52.420
I must

00:28:53.952 --> 00:28:55.699
marry you regardless.

00:28:57.140 --> 00:28:58.340
Therefore,

00:28:58.656 --> 00:28:59.488
you trapped us

00:28:59.488 --> 00:29:00.779
together in the Treasure Hall.

00:29:01.280 --> 00:29:02.176
Your sect

00:29:02.176 --> 00:29:04.019
certainly went...

00:29:04.544 --> 00:29:05.900
to extremes.

00:29:05.900 --> 00:29:07.140
That's creative.

00:29:07.340 --> 00:29:08.768
Master's obsession runs deep,

00:29:09.259 --> 00:29:10.944
but it's all for

00:29:10.944 --> 00:29:11.779
our sect's sake.

00:29:11.779 --> 00:29:13.100
As the chief disciple,

00:29:13.180 --> 00:29:14.019
I must

00:29:14.019 --> 00:29:15.380
share Master's burdens.

00:29:15.539 --> 00:29:16.739
You promised earlier

00:29:16.820 --> 00:29:17.940
to stay willingly.

00:29:18.259 --> 00:29:19.539
From today onward,

00:29:20.019 --> 00:29:21.459
I'll treat you well.

00:29:21.920 --> 00:29:23.380
You orchestrated all this

00:29:24.192 --> 00:29:25.059
just to

00:29:25.259 --> 00:29:27.420
boost Yuanji Sect's glory?

00:29:32.128 --> 00:29:32.940
Then why did you

00:29:32.940 --> 00:29:34.380
use those vines to harm me?

00:29:34.739 --> 00:29:35.620
Vines?

00:29:36.256 --> 00:29:37.019
Harm you?

00:29:37.920 --> 00:29:38.820
You didn't?

00:29:39.620 --> 00:29:40.416
I...

00:29:58.656 --> 00:29:59.264
This one

00:29:59.264 --> 00:30:00.940
was found by you outside the city.

00:30:01.792 --> 00:30:03.259
This one was found just now.

00:30:03.459 --> 00:30:04.299
Both flowers

00:30:04.699 --> 00:30:05.580
are identical.

00:30:06.019 --> 00:30:08.100
The formation is sinister and cruel.

00:30:08.960 --> 00:30:10.176
Only the dark cultivators

00:30:10.176 --> 00:30:11.520
well-versed in herbal poisons

00:30:11.520 --> 00:30:12.259
could achieve it.

00:30:12.940 --> 00:30:14.459
Go to Huang Qi Residence

00:30:14.699 --> 00:30:16.340
and have Master Huang Qi examine them.

00:30:17.299 --> 00:30:17.940
Right away.

00:30:20.940 --> 00:30:22.620
Young Master, where are you going?

00:30:23.140 --> 00:30:24.180
To find Kong Hou.

00:30:24.580 --> 00:30:25.299
Wait.

00:30:25.580 --> 00:30:27.699
She's definitely
under tight surveillance now.

00:30:27.779 --> 00:30:28.640
If you go now,

00:30:28.640 --> 00:30:29.900
what if you get caught?

00:30:30.219 --> 00:30:30.979
Besides,

00:30:30.979 --> 00:30:32.340
your health is still weak.

00:30:32.340 --> 00:30:33.140
Don't go.

00:30:33.140 --> 00:30:33.728
Stay put

00:30:33.728 --> 00:30:34.420
and wait.

00:30:34.660 --> 00:30:35.979
She'll be scared alone.

00:30:36.019 --> 00:30:36.580
Wait.

00:30:37.380 --> 00:30:38.779
Whether she's afraid...

00:30:39.584 --> 00:30:43.345
(Joy)

00:31:31.699 --> 00:31:33.459
Huan Zong, you're finally back.

00:31:33.539 --> 00:31:35.219
I thought they might have...

00:31:36.219 --> 00:31:37.219
Don't worry.

00:31:37.499 --> 00:31:38.739
They can't catch me.

00:31:40.739 --> 00:31:41.779
What happened?

00:31:41.820 --> 00:31:42.779
This room's

00:31:42.779 --> 00:31:44.059
decorations have changed?

00:31:44.480 --> 00:31:46.699
It was all festive earlier.

00:31:47.699 --> 00:31:49.019
It annoyed me to look at.

00:31:49.340 --> 00:31:50.019
Besides,

00:31:50.019 --> 00:31:51.420
you aren't really getting married.

00:31:52.620 --> 00:31:53.259
Enough.

00:31:53.580 --> 00:31:54.420
I'll escort you out.

00:31:54.940 --> 00:31:56.180
Escort me out?

00:31:56.180 --> 00:31:56.900
I'm not leaving.

00:31:57.299 --> 00:31:59.072
Those Yuanji Sect people

00:31:59.072 --> 00:32:00.699
first tried to force me into marriage,

00:32:00.860 --> 00:32:02.499
and then dragged me to the flower field,

00:32:02.539 --> 00:32:03.940
nearly killing me.

00:32:04.100 --> 00:32:04.820
I must stay

00:32:04.820 --> 00:32:06.459
to uncover the truth.

00:32:06.739 --> 00:32:07.420
Moreover,

00:32:07.459 --> 00:32:08.384
actually, I...

00:32:17.504 --> 00:32:19.136
(The security outside is so tight.)

00:32:19.136 --> 00:32:20.320
(How did you get in?)

00:32:24.259 --> 00:32:26.340
(I enter where I wish.)

00:32:30.240 --> 00:32:31.820
(When can we get out?)

00:32:31.820 --> 00:32:33.180
(What's your next plan?)

00:32:33.219 --> 00:32:34.272
(Any discoveries?)

00:32:34.272 --> 00:32:35.539
(What's Yuanji Sect's goal?)

00:32:39.779 --> 00:32:40.416
We wait.

00:32:53.059 --> 00:32:54.739
We've made progress.

00:32:55.059 --> 00:32:56.499
Have some patience.

00:33:01.440 --> 00:33:02.208
Lift your clothes.

00:33:02.208 --> 00:33:03.328
Let me check your injuries.

00:33:03.779 --> 00:33:04.779
Lift my clothes?

00:33:04.820 --> 00:33:06.240
What are you doing?

00:33:13.940 --> 00:33:15.299
What do you think?

00:33:15.499 --> 00:33:16.779
I want to examine the wounds

00:33:16.779 --> 00:33:17.632
where the vines

00:33:17.632 --> 00:33:19.100
drained your spiritual energy.

00:33:22.900 --> 00:33:25.059
Y-You should've said so earlier.

00:33:30.496 --> 00:33:31.136
Turn over.

00:33:36.259 --> 00:33:36.979
Strange.

00:33:37.739 --> 00:33:39.380
There's no trace at all.

00:33:44.768 --> 00:33:46.499
Something just occurred to me.

00:33:46.752 --> 00:33:47.328
When I was

00:33:47.328 --> 00:33:48.979
trapped by the vines,

00:33:49.380 --> 00:33:50.720
the flower that bloomed...

00:33:51.008 --> 00:33:53.088
I've seen Jin Ling wear it before.

00:33:59.392 --> 00:34:02.140
But it can't be Jin Ling.

00:34:02.340 --> 00:34:04.380
She's always wanted me gone.

00:34:28.740 --> 00:34:29.619
Jin Ling.

00:34:37.459 --> 00:34:39.139
Jin Ling, wait.

00:34:42.592 --> 00:34:44.032
I-I never imagined

00:34:44.032 --> 00:34:45.499
things would turn out like this.

00:34:46.380 --> 00:34:48.860
This matter isn't yours
nor Senior Zhou Xiao's to decide.

00:34:48.860 --> 00:34:49.740
Nor mine.

00:34:50.619 --> 00:34:51.700
Another thing.

00:34:52.128 --> 00:34:53.216
Do you remember

00:34:53.216 --> 00:34:55.099
wearing this flower before?

00:34:56.780 --> 00:34:57.539
Right.

00:34:58.099 --> 00:34:59.072
When we met

00:34:59.072 --> 00:34:59.979
in Sanshu City,

00:34:59.979 --> 00:35:01.340
I was wearing it.

00:35:01.664 --> 00:35:02.720
Then do you recall

00:35:02.720 --> 00:35:04.539
where you obtained it?

00:35:05.420 --> 00:35:06.780
I found it

00:35:07.552 --> 00:35:08.608
in the flower field.

00:35:08.800 --> 00:35:09.619
Flower field?

00:35:09.619 --> 00:35:10.900
Are you sure?

00:35:13.979 --> 00:35:15.820
When I was there earlier,

00:35:15.860 --> 00:35:17.260
I nearly...

00:35:20.059 --> 00:35:20.979
Let me go.

00:35:23.104 --> 00:35:23.744
Are you saying

00:35:23.744 --> 00:35:24.900
you almost got killed there?

00:35:26.016 --> 00:35:27.872
Do you know

00:35:27.872 --> 00:35:28.940
who grows this flower?

00:35:33.940 --> 00:35:34.900
Kong Hou,

00:35:35.744 --> 00:35:37.579
may I borrow this flower?

00:35:55.579 --> 00:35:56.780
How is that possible?

00:35:57.220 --> 00:35:58.900
How could this flower be problematic?

00:36:00.499 --> 00:36:01.940
And these vines...

00:36:09.059 --> 00:36:10.380
It's you.

00:36:10.579 --> 00:36:11.900
Why are you here?

00:36:30.112 --> 00:36:31.776
I wonder
if Senior Zhou Xiao will like it.

00:36:32.380 --> 00:36:33.380
Senior Jin Ling.

00:36:33.619 --> 00:36:34.499
Coming.

00:36:41.824 --> 00:36:43.700
I wanted to kill you back then.

00:36:44.099 --> 00:36:46.780
But you got lucky.

00:36:46.780 --> 00:36:48.740
W-Why exactly do you...

00:37:10.700 --> 00:37:12.300
Jin Ling asked me for that flower.

00:37:12.300 --> 00:37:13.380
She must know something.

00:37:13.380 --> 00:37:14.880
She must be investigating on her own.

00:37:15.040 --> 00:37:16.179
We need to find her quickly.

00:37:16.260 --> 00:37:17.700
She hasn't moved for a long time.

00:37:17.700 --> 00:37:18.860
She may have gone elsewhere.

00:37:19.104 --> 00:37:20.019
The field is there.

00:37:20.059 --> 00:37:20.979
Lady Kong Hou.

00:37:20.979 --> 00:37:21.940
Why did you come out?

00:37:21.940 --> 00:37:22.780
Senior Zhou Xiao,

00:37:22.912 --> 00:37:23.680
enough talking.

00:37:23.680 --> 00:37:24.579
Jin Ling is in danger.

00:37:24.579 --> 00:37:25.499
What happened to her?

00:37:25.499 --> 00:37:26.240
Let's go.

00:37:26.860 --> 00:37:28.300
Please don't.

00:37:28.740 --> 00:37:29.856
Today you came

00:37:29.888 --> 00:37:31.059
to me yourself.

00:37:31.420 --> 00:37:32.860
If I don't kill you,

00:37:33.059 --> 00:37:35.300
wouldn't that waste your goodwill?

00:37:44.740 --> 00:37:46.179
You chase. I'll tend to Jin Ling.

00:37:46.179 --> 00:37:46.820
After him.

00:37:48.979 --> 00:37:49.740
Jin Ling?

00:37:49.740 --> 00:37:50.820
Are you alright, Jin Ling?

00:37:50.979 --> 00:37:53.216
Jin Ling, wake up. Jin Ling?

00:37:57.659 --> 00:37:58.619
Who exactly are you?

00:37:58.619 --> 00:37:59.780
Why did you hurt Jin Ling?

00:38:22.099 --> 00:38:23.979
You know the terrain so well.

00:38:24.179 --> 00:38:25.820
You're from Yuanji Sect.

00:38:52.096 --> 00:38:54.179
Why is your spiritual energy so weak?

00:38:54.495 --> 00:38:55.620
You visited that field too?

00:38:56.139 --> 00:38:56.820
No.

00:38:57.499 --> 00:38:58.900
I haven't been to the flower field.

00:39:01.248 --> 00:39:02.048
Forgive my rudeness.

00:39:09.376 --> 00:39:10.688
Your heart's blood was taken?

00:39:52.222 --> 00:39:54.789
♪Roaming with the wind♪

00:39:55.234 --> 00:39:57.545
♪Wandering about♪

00:39:57.997 --> 00:40:02.808
♪A final ember of warmth abides♪

00:40:03.942 --> 00:40:06.108
♪Absurd plots unfold♪

00:40:06.584 --> 00:40:09.098
♪Mere spectators♪

00:40:09.362 --> 00:40:13.892
♪Footprints left on shores♪

00:40:15.227 --> 00:40:17.650
♪Fickle kisses burn♪

00:40:17.923 --> 00:40:20.715
♪Withering in an instant♪

00:40:20.830 --> 00:40:25.614
♪Lanterns glow, depicting her grace♪

00:40:26.493 --> 00:40:29.025
♪Like rusted locks♪

00:40:29.393 --> 00:40:31.994
♪Chaining our memories♪

00:40:32.324 --> 00:40:37.286
♪Only scars remain♪

00:40:37.630 --> 00:40:40.298
♪Breaking from worldly desires♪

00:40:40.510 --> 00:40:43.216
♪Dreams shattered, but reality rolls on♪

00:40:43.326 --> 00:40:49.022
♪Letting down my guard,
drowning in the perilous love♪

00:40:49.022 --> 00:40:51.741
♪You stole my heart♪

00:40:51.870 --> 00:40:54.600
♪Vows scatter with the air♪

00:40:54.782 --> 00:41:00.105
♪All the wounds will heal with care♪

00:41:00.105 --> 00:41:03.464
♪Love is mystery♪

00:41:03.807 --> 00:41:06.381
♪So be it♪

00:41:06.494 --> 00:41:09.415
♪She blazes uncontrolled♪

00:41:09.627 --> 00:41:11.908
♪A sickness of the soul♪

00:41:11.908 --> 00:41:14.910
♪Cold nights take their toll♪

00:41:15.070 --> 00:41:17.502
♪So be it♪

00:41:17.752 --> 00:41:24.051
♪All efforts go unrewarded♪

00:41:26.058 --> 00:41:28.702
♪Breaking from worldly desires♪

00:41:29.210 --> 00:41:31.874
♪Dreams shattered, but reality rolls on♪

00:41:32.030 --> 00:41:37.660
♪Letting down my guard,
drowning in the perilous love♪

00:41:37.660 --> 00:41:40.277
♪You stole my heart♪

00:41:40.558 --> 00:41:43.139
♪Vows scatter with the air♪

00:41:43.326 --> 00:41:50.344
♪All the wounds will heal with care♪

00:41:52.126 --> 00:41:54.654
♪So be it♪